           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9261-8390"))
  )
Description: Reproducible analysis code and data for a study of the
    microtexts embedded in the "Aeolus" episode of James Joyce's
    Ulysses, treated as social-media-like content. Provides functions
    to load and tokenise the source text, run lexicon-based and
    LLM-based sentiment analysis, and support related research
    questions on nationalism and resemblance to user-generated content.
